: placed**\n- 3 \u00d7 DK-200 USB-C Dock (new) at $189 each = $567\n- 3 \u00d7 MN-27 27\" 4K Monitor (new) at $329 each = $987\n- **Total: $1,554.** That's under the $2,500 limit, so no manager approval was needed.\n\nDK-200 was in stock, so I didn't need the DK-210. I also skipped the cheaper refurbished DK-200-R.\n\n**There was a problem on the first try.** The first order request timed out. I retried it safely, and found it had only gone through partway: order PO0001 had the 3 docks ($567) but no monitors. Because you wanted a single order, I cancelled PO0001 and placed the full order again as PO0002. PO0001 now shows as cancelled, which should trigger a refund. It's worth confirming that the $567 refund actually reaches the budget.", "type": "text"}]}]}